Z||000000||batboy||10-21-2000||10:23 AM||||'m the proud first time owner of a mint 1998 Grand Prix GT coupe with only 22k miles and totally loaded. Here is my first pic of it looking out my front porch. It was after dark when I got home and this sight greeted me this morning. I'll try to post a better pic later today when I'm out cruising.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GP-GT-trailered.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/batkid3.gif">  <B>BATBOY</B><BR>85 SE with 350 Chevy V8 (Batmobile)<BR>85 GT (daily driver), & 87 SE (dead)||||reg||1
